OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Flargely easing this evening, leading
OL,7,Fto a dry and clear night for many,
OL,8,Fallowing a few mist patches to
OL,9,Fdevelop. A cooler night than Monday
OL,10,Fnight, although turning milder again
OL,11,Flater as a strengthening southwesterly
OL,12,Fwind develops.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FPlenty of sunshine around
OL,15,Fto start on Wednesday. Still feeling
OL,16,Fmild, with cloud building through the
OL,17,Fmorning. Very windy with gales along
OL,18,Fexposed coasts and on hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
